  "method": "For each (build channel, launch-argument combination) pair: uninstall the app, reinstall the fresh build, `xcrun simctl launch <udid> <bundle id> [args...]`, wait for the app's own Babel2LaunchTraceRecorder to log its 8-event structured trace via OSLog, capture with `xcrun simctl spawn <udid> log show --info --style compact --predicate 'process == \"NetNewsWire-iOS\"'`, and parse the JSON trace-result line (source: iOS/Babel2/Babel2FeatureGate.swift Babel2LaunchTrace.resultJSONLine). This reproduces the fresh Phase 2A r8 methodology (see VALIDATION.md) but rebuilt at the current commit and extended to a full argument matrix instead of just no-args/-GenesisV2.",
